{
  "title": "One service calls another",
  "lesson": "microservices/02-services-talking",
  "kind": "http",
  "needs": [
    "docker"
  ],
  "edit": [
    "orders/server.mjs"
  ],
  "up": [
    "docker",
    "compose",
    "-p",
    "z2d-ms01-{port}",
    "up",
    "-d",
    "--build"
  ],
  "down": [
    "docker",
    "compose",
    "-p",
    "z2d-ms01-{port}",
    "down",
    "-v",
    "--remove-orphans",
    "--rmi",
    "local",
    "-t",
    "2"
  ],
  "start_timeout": 300,
  "timeout": 30,
  "requests": [
    {
      "name": "GET /health",
      "path": "/health",
      "status": 200,
      "json": {
        "status": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "GET /orders/1 includes the user from the users service",
      "path": "/orders/1",
      "status": 200,
      "json": {
        "id": 1,
        "item": "Book",
        "user": {
          "id": 1,
          "name": "Ada"
        }
      },
      "retry": 15
    },
    {
      "name": "GET /orders/2",
      "path": "/orders/2",
      "status": 200,
      "json": {
        "id": 2,
        "item": "Pen",
        "user": {
          "id": 2,
          "name": "Linus"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an order whose user is unknown has user null",
      "path": "/orders/3",
      "status": 200,
      "json": {
        "id": 3,
        "item": "Lamp",
        "user": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an unknown order answers 404",
      "path": "/orders/99",
      "status": 404,
      "json": {
        "error": "order not found"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "any other path answers 404",
      "path": "/nope",
      "status": 404,
      "json": {
        "error": "not found"
      }
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "const match = req.url.match(/^\\/orders\\/(\\d+)$/); gives the id in match[1]. Convert it with Number.",
    "const response = await fetch(`${USERS_URL}/users/${order.userId}`);",
    "A 404 from the users service is a normal answer: the user is null. Anything else that is not ok is a failure: answer 502.",
    "Wrap the call in try/catch. fetch rejects when the service cannot be reached."
  ]
}
